<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Lettera in Busta</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .envelope-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 300px;
            height: 200px;
            right:10%;
            perspective: 1000px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .envelope {
            width: 200%;
            height: 100%;
            position: relative;
            background: #f5deb3; /* Colore busta */
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .envelope-top {
            width: 100%;
            height: 49.5%;
            background: #deb887; /* Colore piega della busta */
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            transform-origin: top;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease-in-out;
            border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
        }
 .envelope-down {
            width: 100%;
            height: 50%;
            background: #deb887; /* Colore piega della busta */
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 0;
            transform-origin: top;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease-in-out;
            border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;
        }


        .seal {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            background: red;
            border-radius: 50%;
            position: absolute;
            top: calc(50% - 25px);
            left: calc(50% - 25px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            z-index: 2;
        }
        .envelope-container.open .seal{
            transform: translateY(-400%);
            transition: transform 0.4s ease-in-out;
            z-index: 1;

        }
        .letter {
            position: absolute;
            top: -55%;
            left: 0;
            width: 180%;
            height: 100%;
            left:10%;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            transform: translateY(+100%);
            opacity: 0;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease-in-out, opacity 0.5s ease-in-out;
            padding: 20px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            z-index: 3;
        }

        .letter h5 {
            font-size: 13px;
            margin: 0;
            color: #333;
        }

        .letter p {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #555;
            margin: 5px 0 0;
        }

      
        .envelope-container.open .envelope-top {
            transform: rotateX(-180deg);
          border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;
        }

        .envelope-container.open .letter {
            transform: translateY(0);
            opacity: 1;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="envelope-container" id="envelopeBox">
        <div class="envelope">
            <div class="envelope-top"></div>
            <div class="seal"></div>
            <div class="envelope-down"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="letter" id="letterContent">
            <h5>Gentili ospiti,</h5>

<p>con grande dispiacere comunichiamo che, a causa delle condizioni di salute del signor Thompson, la festa prevista per il 02/01/1961 non potrà avere luogo.</p>

<p>Il signor Thompson non si sente bene e, per garantire la sua piena guarigione e il miglior recupero possibile, abbiamo deciso di rimandare l'evento a data da destinarsi.</p>

<p>Ci scusiamo sinceramente per eventuali disagi causati e vi aggiorneremo non appena avremo una nuova data da proporre.</p>

<p>Nel frattempo, vi ringraziamo per la vostra comprensione e vi auguriamo il meglio.</p>

<p>Cordiali saluti,</p>
<p><strong>C. Thompson</strong></p>
           
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        const envelopeBox = document.getElementById('envelopeBox');

        envelopeBox.addEventListener('click', () => {
            envelopeBox.classList.toggle('open');
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
